# Typography

- Always use **Nunito** as the application UI font (sans / headings).
- Load via `next/font/google` (`Nunito`) and wire through `--font-nunito` / Tailwind `font-sans`.
- Do not switch the product UI to Geist, Inter, Roboto, Arial, or system UI stacks for body/UI text.
- Mono may remain a separate monospace font for code-only contexts.
